o_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-596470a2af70878aEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-f037bc3c9a8ba1bbEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_BOOK_LOW_BasiliskGate_MurderInvestigations</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_BasiliskGate_MurderInvestigations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_BasiliskGate_MurderInvestigations\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">d9ecb5d7-bb47-41c0-976e-6ca0d7187f42</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d9ecb5d7-bb47-41c0-976e-6ca0d7187f42\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d9ecb5d7-bb47-41c0-976e-6ca0d7187f42\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a desk in <a href=\"/wiki/Heapside_Prison\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Heapside Prison\">Heapside Prison</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1279&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;776</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A status update on an ongoing investigation. It details the stark increase in murders in the city, as well as the violence of the crimes. No leads to the killer have been found. It concludes with a recommendation to keep the public in the dark for as long as possible, or until the killer is brought to justice.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202233\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1350/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24333/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6015/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931227/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.205      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   42.205      1 -total\n 51.43%   21.707      6 Template:Icon_text\n 46.14%   19.475     15 Template:Trim\n 25.86%   10.915      2 Template:Uid\n 14.99%    6.326      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.77%    5.810      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.95%    4.620      1 Template:Books\n 10.30%    4.349      1 Template:Icon_link\n 10.12%    4.270      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34911-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202233 and revision id 330079. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}